{"title":"What should I ask Joel Mokyr?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/943986254/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-Joel-Mokyr.html","date":1769936717000,"content":"<p>Yes, I will be doing a Conversation with him.  He is of course one of this last year’s Nobel Laureates in economics, here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/?s=mokyr\" target=\"_blank\">previous MR coverage of him</a>.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joel_Mokyr\" target=\"_blank\">Wikipedia</a>.</p>\r\n<p>He has a recent book <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Two-Paths-Prosperity-Institutions-1000-2000/dp/0691265941/ref=sr_1_1?crid=3JUILJJ44MAD0&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.v8bNu9yldGWXsH6o1ep0f_HFdp7Sz79Ixs1zdadEeZrymbaW_mpMPfyEUplCiaCe6s58SgeIDfiJRGwOOEobK2aw1U4mGvcfrlN8a6s25Sg5nF58c-RWNLhdSL4XK9LqOQhpFZddT7jMOAW3cjis4Hgpiz8zPh3cT6Pl3xVl1gbVXeVwj_EB7SA8Ia2y7TYGyJEvboKp1UAHkVDhvvu850DDswGwelxfiyebeyWeSIk.j2CAlRkuUeNl9wSE8Iw3A2alybY6CWKWVYXmkGc9sWM&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=joel+mokyr&amp;qid=1769900722&amp;sprefix=joel+mokyr%2Caps%2C220&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Two Paths to Prosperity: Culture and Institutions in Europe and China, 1000-2000</a>, co-authored with Avner Greif and Guido Tabellini.</p>\r\n<p>So what should I ask him?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/02/what-should-i-ask-joel-mokyr.html\">What should I ask Joel Mokyr?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/943986254/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/943986254/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https:/